{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ESC (Electronics Security Company)</strong> is a hacking game that challenges players to step into the shoes of an &quot;ethical&quot; hacker. As an infiltrator, you are entrusted with hacking into various computer systems to accomplish  objectives and unveil hidden secrets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811590/extras/6512e47870c89146f763ac7df26e03b3.poster.avif?t=1766570043\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811590/extras/6512e47870c89146f763ac7df26e03b3.webm?t=1766570043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811590/extras/6512e47870c89146f763ac7df26e03b3.mp4?t=1766570043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you must strategically navigate through a diverse range of scenarios, each presenting unique challenges and objectives. Work through a variety of missions as you infiltrate systems to unravel hidden secrets and retrieve sensitive information.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811590/extras/6a8c0d5939b3c2f226e2965ad56da85e.poster.avif?t=1766570043\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811590/extras/6a8c0d5939b3c2f226e2965ad56da85e.webm?t=1766570043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811590/extras/6a8c0d5939b3c2f226e2965ad56da85e.mp4?t=1766570043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ob